sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 038 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Grieneisen et al. (2007) Nature & Mähönen et al. (2014) Nature reverse-fountain root tip auxin reflux capacitor, Quiescent Center exponential accumulation, and PLETHORA meristem zonality — MorphoEval overall 53.5/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2014-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain.py` (weighted score: 54.4/100). The Pass 1 script implements only a 1D 2-stream (stele + epidermis) finite-difference toy model at WT and k_lat = 0 without the full 2D 5-tissue root tip cellular lattice (stele, pericycle/endodermis, cortex, epidermis/LRC, and columella/QC), without Mähönen et al. (2014) PLETHORA (PLT1/2) transcription factor synthesis/diffusion and Meristem/Elongation/Differentiation zone boundary positioning, without the shoot-decapitation autonomy test (J_in = 0), pin2/eir1 mutant, NPA polar transport blockade, or QC laser-ablation proximal regeneration shift, and without empirical CV segmentation of the vendored Arabidopsis primary root meristem confocal micrograph. Overall 53.5/100 (faithfulness 50.8, reproducibility 59.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 55, Morphological realism / specimen match 45, Parameter expressivity 52, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 58, Reproducibility package 54. Output judged: docs/media/root_auxin_reflux_fountain_comparison.png: rendered output of 2014-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain.py at 8871db0, image/png, 60812 B, 1400×588 px, artifact_sha256 24bbb9e18ef0ef8c6bbaee2c3ac9df8b234cd9ebaa3ce433911f3e570ca5bead (sha256 24bbb9e18ef0ef8c6bbaee2c3ac9df8b234cd9ebaa3ce433911f3e570ca5bead), spec_fingerprint 5f9ff984dd3572c3a2bb1124d68b38a94c8ae92664796e5dd367404918a3bd5f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 5f9ff984dd3572c3a2bb1124d68b38a94c8ae92664796e5dd367404918a3bd5f; artifact_sha256: 24bbb9e18ef0ef8c6bbaee2c3ac9df8b234cd9ebaa3ce433911f3e570ca5bead; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/arabidopsis_root_meristem_specimen.jpg=1b962c21e75c8e72..., datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/paper_citations.bib=069ef06b9ad6bdfb..., datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/root_auxin_reflux_fountain_reference.json=1fc68ce109094fc5..., datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/scout_manifest.json=285fff11a61df708...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D auxin reflux capacitor to Mähönen et al. (2014) PLETHORA (PLT1/2) transcription factor synthesis, intercellular movement, and growth dilution to predict Meristematic Zone (z_MZ), Elongation Zone (z_EZ), and Differentiation Zone boundaries across all 6 experimental regimes (Wild-Type, shoot decapitation J_in=0 autonomy, pin2/eir1, lateral-PIN ablation, NPA blockade, and QC laser-ablation proximal regeneration).",
            "remediation needed: Segment the SHA-256-verified 3-panel Arabidopsis thaliana primary root meristem confocal micrograph (`arabidopsis_root_meristem_specimen.jpg`) to extract root meristem area fraction, DAPI nuclear file count (113), Alexa Fluor 488 mitotic division foci (125), intercellular nuclear spacing, and apical-to-proximal nuclear density ratio.",
            "remediation needed: Upgrade to a 2D 5-tissue root tip cellular lattice solver (stele, pericycle/endodermis, cortex, epidermis/LRC, and columella/QC) integrating Grieneisen et al. (2007) anisotropic PIN1/PIN2/PIN3/PIN4/PIN7 polar transport and verifying exact vascular-epidermal counter-current flux conservation." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.535"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
}

